00:51:45.310 --> 00:51:48.930
He's saying, you know, the recruiter told me my eyes were too bad to enliSt.

1331
00:51:49.190 --> 00:51:50.330
Phyllis is like, I'm sorry.

1332
00:51:50.330 --> 00:51:52.270
It sounds like you really wanted to go to Vietnam.

1333
00:51:52.470 --> 00:51:53.650
Can I have some more of that brandy?

1334
