00:57:08.450 --> 00:57:11.290
Well, Phyllis reminded me of another thing about Leslie.

1465
00:57:11.630 --> 00:57:20.090
She said whenever they were at a work party and he would meet someone for the first time without missing a beat, if he saw them at the next work party,

1466
00:57:20.230 --> 00:57:21.330
he could remember their name.

1467
00:57:22.390 --> 00:57:23.350
That's amazing.

1468
00:57:23.630 --> 00:57:23.930
Yes.

1469
00:57:24.090 --> 00:57:24.770
That's a talent.

1470
00:57:25.550 --> 00:57:27.090
I remember that about him.

1471
00:57:27.370 --> 00:57:32.710
It was pretty incredible, actually, because we would meet a lot of people at those events.

1472
00:57:32.990 --> 00:57:34.770
And he would remember everybody.

1473
00:57:35.330 --> 00:57:35.510
Yeah.

1474
