He said, OK, over a nine-year period, about five a year, over, hmm, I think 60 books we went through.

1482
00:58:11.390 --> 00:58:13.890
Sixty books of crossword puzzles.

1483
00:58:14.010 --> 00:58:14.060
That's what he said.

1484
00:58:14.060 --> 00:58:14.470
That's what he said.

1485
